OL,3,GNEWSAPCs joke about death of Paul
OL,4,AHardcastle's son
OL,5,
OL,6,FEssex Police has apologised after
OL,7,Fofficers were captured on body-worn
OL,8,Fvideo joking about the death of
OL,9,Fmusician Paul Hardcastle's son in a
OL,10,Fcrash.
OL,12,FPaul Jr, 35, was being pursued by
OL,13,Fpolice when his motorcycle collided
OL,14,Fwith a van near Ongar on 12 January,
OL,15,Fkilling him.
OL,17,FHis father told The Times newspaper he
OL,18,Fwas "completely stunned" by the
OL,19,Ffootage, which showed three female
OL,20,Fconstables joking about Paul Jr's
OL,21,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
