OL,3,GNEWSAPCs joke about death of Paul
OL,4,AHardcastle's son
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Supt Scott Egerton, of Essex Police,
OL,7,Fapologised and described their remarks
OL,8,Fas "needless, insensitive and
OL,9,Funacceptable".
